{"file": "天灾末世，她囤满物资后所向披靡！-第45集.mp4", "ep": 45, "duration": 46.8, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 1.0, "text": "有肉一起吃"}, {"start": 1.0, "end": 2.24, "text": "有活一起干嘛"}, {"start": 3.67, "end": 4.99, "text": "糖减快"}, {"start": 4.99, "end": 6.67, "text": "贺章瓶力气大"}, {"start": 6.67, "end": 8.43, "text": "王横控火"}, {"start": 8.43, "end": 9.83, "text": "一整对一能"}, {"start": 9.83, "end": 11.51, "text": "收一个亏了"}, {"start": 11.51, "end": 14.04, "text": "不如成窝端回来"}, {"start": 14.04, "end": 15.16, "text": "老大"}, {"start": 15.16, "end": 16.72, "text": "这也太多了吧"}, {"start": 16.72, "end": 17.96, "text": "这算傻"}, {"start": 17.96, "end": 18.88, "text": "跟着我"}, {"start": 18.88, "end": 20.86, "text": "吃是最基础的"}, {"start": 20.86, "end": 23.47, "text": "习惯就好"}, {"start": 23.47, "end": 24.39, "text": "娘子"}, {"start": 24.39, "end": 25.67, "text": "把菜收了吧"}, {"start": 25.67, "end": 26.87, "text": "我看你也吃不多"}, {"start": 26.87, "end": 28.27, "text": "往后少背点"}, {"start": 28.27, "end": 29.07, "text": "老大"}, {"start": 29.07, "end": 31.52, "text": "我还没吃饱"}, {"start": 31.52, "end": 32.72, "text": "没饱啊"}, {"start": 32.72, "end": 33.84, "text": "那接着吃"}, {"start": 33.84, "end": 36.25, "text": "我进去消消室"}, {"start": 36.25, "end": 37.17, "text": "趁热吃"}, {"start": 43.56, "end": 45.17, "text": "好啊"}, {"start": 45.17, "end": 46.85, "text": "谁准你们偷吃我的菜"}]}